  "solution": {
    "text": "According to Gauss law, <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ϕ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></math><br/><br/>Let electric flux linked with surfaces <math><mi>A</mi><mo>,</mo><mi> </mi><mi>B</mi><mi> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi> </mi><mi>C</mi></math> are<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ϕ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ϕ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi></math>and<math><mi> </mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ϕ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow></msub></math> respectively. That is<br/><br/><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ϕ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ϕ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ϕ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ϕ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow></msub></math><br/><br/>Since  <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ϕ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ϕ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow></msub></math><br/><br/><math><mo>∴</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ϕ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ϕ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ϕ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></math><br/><br/><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi> </mi><mi> </mi><mi> </mi><mi> </mi><mi> </mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ϕ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ε</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ϕ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></math><br/><br/><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ϕ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ϕ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br/><br/>Hence,   <br/><br/><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ϕ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ε</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ϕ</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>"
